.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-pr-status - List open pull requests for one repository or matching workspace repositories


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit pr status [pattern] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Displays all open pull requests for the current repository on GitHub.

.PP
With a pattern, selects workspace repositories by name instead. Only '*' is special and matches any run of characters; everything else is literal and matching is case-insensitive. Quote the pattern in the shell so it is not glob-expanded.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope

.PP
\fB--manifest\fP=""
	Path to workspace.yaml (default: /workspace.yaml)

.PP
\fB--no-url\fP[=false]
	Hide pull request URLs


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--dir\fP="."
	Path to repository directory (default: current directory)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  orbit pr status
  orbit pr status falak
  orbit pr status 'falak*'
  orbit pr status '*'
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-pr(1)\fP
